Currently everything is implemented in MEC. That folder contains all the code to produce unweighted events for CC and EM interactions
Folders for events at 
	-monoenergetic leptons at fixed lepton scattering angle (Fixed_Kinematics)
	-monoenergetic leptons integrated over everything (AllAngles)
	-Flux folded and integrated over everything (FluxFolded)
	-monoenergetic leptons at fixed lepton scattering angle, fixed proton theta/phi (used for (e,e'p)) (SemiExclusive)

To use one of these, start inside MEC/
	- make a build directory 'mkdir build_dir'
	- cd into that build directory 'cd build_dir'
	- use cmake to compile whichever source code directory 'cmake ../source_dir'
	- build the executable 'make -jN'
	- executable can be run via '-mpirun -np NCORES ./evgen < input_file.dat'


